{"id":"n3-046","title":"～つもりでした (〜tsumori deshita)","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Expressing a past intention or plan; 'was planning to', 'meant to'.","longExplanation":"The ～つもりでした grammar point is used to express a past intention or plan that did not happen, or a past belief that turned out incorrect. It can be translated as 'was planning to', 'intended to', or 'meant to'.","formation":"Verb-casual (dictionary form) + つもりでした","examples":[{"jp":"昨日は友達に会うつもりでしたが、風邪を引いてしまいました。","romaji":"Kinou wa tomodachi ni au tsumori deshita ga, kaze o hiite shimaimashita.","en":"I was planning to meet my friend yesterday, but I caught a cold.","words":[{"surface":"昨日","vocabId":"1579260","reading":"きのう"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"友達","vocabId":"1540170","reading":"ともだち"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"会う","vocabId":"1198180","reading":"あう"},{"surface":"つもり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"でし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"です"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"風邪","vocabId":"1583720","reading":"かぜ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"引い","vocabId":"1169250","reading":"ひく","baseForm":"引く"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しまい","vocabId":"1579490","reading":"しまい","baseForm":"しまう"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]},{"jp":"映画を見るつもりでしたが、時間がなくなりました。","romaji":"Eiga o miru tsumori deshita ga, jikan ga nakunarimashita.","en":"I intended to watch a movie, but I ran out of time.","words":[{"surface":"映画","vocabId":"1173720","reading":"えいが"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見る","vocabId":"1259290","reading":"みる"},{"surface":"つもり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"でし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"です"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"時間","vocabId":"1315920","reading":"じかん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":nu